    "font" : "TimesNewRomanPSMT",
    "font size" : 10.02,
    "text color" : "[0.0]",
    "content" : "Coast of America and play against some of the best USA College Basketball Teams. The tour takes in LA, San Diego, Las Vegas and Phoenix and will last from 28th Nov to 23rd Dec. Well done William and good luck for the Tour. We are very proud of you."
